Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fueled by the power of my spirit,\Nthe great beast has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dots! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When he lost our duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,he must have somehow merged\Ntogether with the great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Tomias!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.27,0:00:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with the Fang of Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And the unstoppable Claw of Hermos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the legendary Knights of Atlantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize those\Nlights! Me too! Me three!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like that night,\Nwhen the gateway first opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo, Yahoo, Yahoo, Yahoo, Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters unite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Without us, all hope is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We must join forces with the humans, and\Ntogether we shall defeat the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, someone's helping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, are you dorks\Njust gonna stand there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you think you can\Nact like men for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out these bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.23,0:02:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear Free, Rocket Warrior,\Nand Guild for the Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I play XYZ Dragon Cannon, Blade\NKnight, and Kaiser Seahorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll add these three cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:03:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackluster Soldier,\NBuster Blader, and Valkyra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.51,0:03:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it can\Nsurvive this butt-kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! What'd I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, looks like we're\Ngonna need a plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that sideshow freak still\Nhas to get past our nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.57,0:04:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, you mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the best time to\Nbe insulting him, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.15,0:04:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to be\Nreunited with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all waiting for you,\Ninside the belly of the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:05:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In just a few short moments, your energy\Nwill be absorbed by the great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't take it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, is that you, Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What Dark said is true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone he caught is now\Ninside of that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well I'm not about to let\Nhim do that to me without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to point out the obvious,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.35,0:05:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're waist high in the\NLeviathan's pit of despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And sinking fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So fighting back isn't\Nexactly an option, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't think of something\Npretty quickly, he wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too far. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in there's counting\Non us to stop this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.53,0:06:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,oh that helps thanks i'm sinking how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,observant but you can\Nmake this a much more
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,pleasant experience by\Nsimply giving in help
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,me yuki chewie i'll save you it's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I must hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, there may be a\Nway to fight back. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,if we can hear the people trapped\Ninside, Maybe they can hear us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one of us is a glimmer of\Nlight in this sea of shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone, we may seem insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But combined together, we radiate\Nenough energy to conquer the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now please, if you can hear me,\Nfocus on the light within your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to save ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember those you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lonely and misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep fighting until\NI break through to you, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember those who have helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,we're almost out hang in there i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.83,0:08:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,try hang on i won't leave without you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,remember what you fought for where's\Nmom she's gone i know where'd
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,she go she was captured oh but i\Npromise that won't happen to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember why you never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never fought a duel like this in my\Nlife. You're pushing me to be my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done it. I've amassed enough\Nsouls to conquer the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the lights of the spirits within.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We must lend our spark\Nto the Pharaoh as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My strength. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I lose it all for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't screw this up, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My control is slipping! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel as if my spirit's been infused with\Nthe power of every soul darts captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the pharaoh,\Nawaken from your ancient slumber!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I call forth the three gods of Egypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been set free!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, how'd you get us out of there, Yook?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,By summoning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,it's obelisk slifer and the winged
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon of ra the egyptian god cards
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:11:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah we know who they are impossible\Nhow did he revive the egyptian gods
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The gods may need my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.23,0:11:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Pharaoh, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to challenge the great Leviathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a lot to learn, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian gods, counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They're powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That leviathan's a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's three on one up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, numbers aren't everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My great leviathan existed long before\Nyour Egyptian gods were even born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And it will rule the Earth long after\Nyour pathetic creatures are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Leviathan, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:12:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk, Fist of Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer, Thunder Force attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.49,0:13:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Raw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignite your mighty blaze cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My beast is fueled by the\Ndarkness of my prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to transform the\Ndarkness in their hearts to light!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:14:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A light which now fuels my beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the gods did pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That means everyone\Nthoughts Gadget is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My! Wake up! It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Val, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dot's got his bum kicked, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So now we're free, thanks\Nto those three blokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, Yugi, and Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.65,0:15:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those friends of yours are all right, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go. Go where? Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonia, Julian
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.43,0:15:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet it's us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We've always been right here\Nby your side, guys. Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right, and we always will be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, see you soon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, bro
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad and Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Julian and Sonya, I know\Nyou'll always be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.19,0:16:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free, thanks to the three chosen\Nduelists You mean, they beat darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that explains all\Nthose lights in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tharo, you did it! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.41,0:17:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are we standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the passage that led us here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Home sweet home, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you sense it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say goodbye just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, there's only one\Nthing left to do, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.79,0:18:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tumaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to my deck at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've tried everything,\Nand nothing seems to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've come to your\Nsenses and given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you figured it out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All the monsters in the world combined\Ntogether couldn't destroy my Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that? Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.83,0:19:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this creature isn't one\Nof your little dual monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It was born from the very\Ndarkness of the human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's that mean? Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you can say,\Nyou insignificant runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is, the great Leviathan was\Ncreated by the hatred and rage of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as mankind exists,\Nso does the great beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, run now and leave these two to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong, Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That creature was created\Nby the Orichalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You were lied to, brainwashed into\Nbelieving mankind must be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But human beings aren't the evil ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When you ruled Atlantis, all of your\Npeople were generous and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But then the Orycalcos stones\Narrived, and everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fragments carried\Nwith them an evil force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought chaos and hatred to paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Orycalcos is using\Nyou to do its dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're never going to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want to wipe out mankind,\Nyou'll have to go through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.55,0:20:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Pharaoh.
